{
  "title": "Duas of the Imams (a.s.) to Ward Off Evil",
  "data": "Imam al-Sadiq (a.s.)\nيَا مَنْ اِذَا اسْتَعَذْتُ بِهِ اَعَاذَنِىْ\nYAA MAN IZAA ISTA'AZTU BEHI A'AAZANEE\nO He Who unquestionably protects me whenever I pray Him for protection,\nوَاِذَا اسْتَجَرْتُ بِهِ عِنْدَ الشَّدَاۤئِدِ اَجَارَنِىْ\nWA IZAA ISTAJARTU BEHI I'NDASH SHADAAA-IDI AJAARANEE\nWho unquestionably shelters me whenever I pray for His shelter against hardships,\nوَاِذَا اسْتَغَثْتُ بِهِ عِنْدَ النَّوَاۤئِبِ اَغَاثَنِىْ\nWA IZAA ISTAGHASTU BEHI I'NDAN NAWAAA-IBI AGHAASANEE\nWho unquestionably aids me whenever I pray for His aid at calamities,\nوَاِذَاسْتَنْصَرْتُ بِهِ عَلٰى عَدُوِّىْ نَصَرَنِىْ وَاَعَانَنِىْ\nWA IZASTANSARTU BEHI A'LAA A'DUWWEE NASARANEE WA A'AANANEE\nand Who unquestionably supports and assists me whenever I pray for His support against my enemy.\nاِلَيْكَ الْمَفْزَعُ\nELAYKAL MAFZA'O\nTowards You is the flight\nوَاَنْتَ الثِّقَةُ\nWA ANTATH THIQATO\nand You are the most trustful;\nفَاقْمَعْ عَنِّىْ مَنْ اَرَادَنِىْ\nFAQMA' A'NNEE MAN ARAADANEE\nso, (please) subdue whoever intends evil to me\nوَاغْلِبْ لِىْ مَنْ كَادَنِىْ\nWAGHLIB LEE MAN KAADANEE\nand overcome whoever plots against me.\nيَا مَنْ قَالَ اِنْ يَّنْصُرْكُمُ اللّٰهُ فَلَا غَالِبَ لَكُمْ\nYAA MAN QAALA IN YYANSURKUMU LAAHO FALAA GHAALEBA LAKUM\nO He Who has said, “If Allah assists you, then there is none that can overcome you.”\nيَا مَنْ نَجَّا نُوْحًا مِنَ الْقَوْمِ الظَّالِمِيْنَ\nYAA MAN NAJJAA NOOHAN MINAL QAWMIZ ZAALIMEEN\nO He Who has saved Noah from the oppressing people!\nيَا مَنْ نَجَّا لُوْطًا مِنَ الْقَوْمِ الْفَاسِقِيْنَ\nYAA MAN NAJJAA LOOTAN MINAL QAWMIL FAASIQEEN\nO He Who has saved Lot from the wicked people!\nيَا مَنْ نَجَّا هُوْدًا مِنَ الْقَوْمِ الْعَادِيْنَ\nYAA MAN NAJJAA HOODAN MINAL QAWMIL A'AADEEN\nO He Who has saved Hud from the transgressing people!\nيَا مَنْ نَجَّا مُحَمَّدًا صَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلَيْهِ وَاٰلِهٖ مِنَ الْقَوْمِ الْكَافِرِيْنَ\nYAA MAN NAJJAA MUHAMMADAN SALLAL LAAHO A'LAYHI WA AALIHI MINAL QAWMIL KAAFIREEN\nO He Who has saved Muhammad, Allah's blessings be upon him and his Household, from the disbelieving people!\nنَجِّنِىْ مِنْ اَعْدَاۤئِىْ وَاَعْدَاۤئِكَ\nNAJJINEE MIN A'DAAA-EE WA A'DAAA-IKA\n(Please) save me from my and Your enemies,\nبِاَسْمَاۤئِكَ يَا رَحْمٰنُ يَا رَحِيْمُ\nBI-ASMAAA-IKA YAA RAHMAANO YAA RAHEEM\nin the name of Your Names; O All-beneficent, O All-merciful.\nلَا سَبِيْلَ لَهُمْ عَلٰى مَنْ تَعَوَّذَ بِالْقُرْاٰنِ\nLAA SABEELA LAHUM A'LAA MAN TA'AWWAZA BIL QUR-AAN\nThey have no way to harm whoever prays the protection of the Qur'an\nوَاسْتَجَارَكَ بِالرَّحِيْمِ الرَّحْمٰنِ\nWASTAJAARAKA BIR RAHEEMIR RAHMAAN\nand prays the shelter of You in the name of Your Names: the All-merciful and the All-beneficent.\nاَلرَّحْمٰنُ عَلَى الْعَرْشِ اسْتَوٰى\nAR-RAHMAAN A'LAL A'RSHIL TAWAA\n“The All-beneficent is firmly established on the throne (of authority).\nاِنَّ بَطْشَ رَبِّكَ لَشَدِيْدٌ\nINNA BATSHA RABBEKA LA-SHADEED\n“Verily the Grip of thy Lord is terrible,\nاِنَّهٗ هُوَ يُبْدِئُ وَيُعِيْدُ\nINNAHU HOWA YUBDEO WA YO-E'ED\nIt is He Who creates from the very beginning, and He can restore (life),\nوَهُوَ الْغَفُوْرُ الْوَدُوْدُ\nWA HOWAL GHAFOORUL WADOODO\nand He is the Oft-Forgiving, Full of Loving-Kindness,\nذُو الْعَرْشِ الْمَجِيْدُ\nZUL A'RSHIL MAJEEDO\nLord of the Throne of Glory,\nفَعَّالٌ لِّمَا يُرِيْدُ\nFA'-A'ALUL LEMAA YOREED\nand Doer (without let) of all that He intends.”\nفَاِنْ تَوَلَّوْا فَقُلْ حَسْبِىَ اللّٰهُ\nFA-IN TAWALLAW FAQUL HASBEAAA LAAHO\n“But if they turn away, then say: 'Allah suffices me:\nلَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّا هُوَ\nLAA ELAAHA ILLAA HOWA\nthere is no god but He.'\nعَلَيْهِ تَوَكَّلْتُ\nA'LAYHE TAWAKKALTU\nOn Him is my trust,\nوَهُوَ رَبُّ الْعَرْشِ الْعَظِيْمِ\nWA HOWA RABBUL A'RSHIL A'ZEEM\nand He is the Lord of the Throne of Glory Supreme.”",
  "tabs": [
    "Imam al-Kazim (a.s.)\nتَوَكَّلْتُ عَلَى الْحَىِّ الَّذِىْ لَا يَمُوْتُ وَتَحَصَّنْتُ بِذِى الْعِزَّةِ وَالْجَبَرُوْتِ وَاسْتَعَنْتُ بِذِى الْكِبْرِيَاۤءِ وَالْمَلَكُوْتِ مَوْلَاىَ اسْتَسْلَمْتُ اِلَيْكَ فَلَا تُسْلِمْنِىْ وَ تَوَكَّلْتُ عَلَيْكَ فَلَا تَخْذُلْنِىْ وَ لَجَاْتُ اِلٰى ظِلِّكَ الْبَسِيْطِ فَلَا تَطْرَحْنِىْ اَنْتَ الْمَطْلَبُ وَ اِلَيْكَ الْمَهْرَبُ تَعْلَمُ مَاۤ اُخْفِىْ وَ مَاۤ اُعْلِنُ وَ تَعْلَمُ خَاۤئِنَةَ الْاَعْيُنِ وَ مَا تُخْفِى الصُّدُوْرُ فَاَمْسِكْ عَنِّى اللّٰهُمَّ اَيْدِى الظَّالِمِيْنَ مِنَ الْجِنِّ وَالْاِنْسِ اَجْمَعِيْنَ وَاشْفِنِىْ وَ عَافِنِىْ يَاۤ اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ.\nTAWAKKALTU A'LAL HAYYIL LAZEE LAA YAMOOTU WATAHASSANTU BIZIL 'IZZATI WAL JABAROOTI WASTA'ANTU BIZIL KIBRIYAA-I WAL MALAKOOTI MAWLAAYASTASLAMTU ILAYKA FALAA TUSLIMNEE WA TAWAKKALTU A'LAYKA FALAA TAKHZULNEE WA LAJA'TU ILAA ZILLIKAL BASEETI FALAA TATRAHNEE ANTAL MATLABU WA ILAYKAL MAHRABU TA'LAMU MAA UKHFEE WA MAA U'LINU WA TA'LAMU KHAA-INATAL A'YUNI WA MAA TUKHFIS SUDOORU FA-AMSIK A'NNIL LAAHUMMA AYDIZ ZAALIMEENA MINAL JINNI WAL INSI AJMA'EENA WASHFINEE WA A'AFINEE YAA ARHAMAR RAAHIMEEN.\nI place my trust in the Ever-living Who never dies; I fortify myself with the Lord of might and omnipotence; and I seek help from the Lord of grandeur and dominion. My Master, I submit myself to You, so do not abandon me; I place my trust in You, so do not forsake me; I take refuge in Your extended shade, so do not cast me away. You are the One sought, and to You is the flight. You know what I conceal and what I reveal, and You know the treachery of the eyes and what the breasts conceal. So hold back from me, O Allah, the hands of the wrongdoers from among the jinn and mankind, all of them; and heal me and grant me well-being, O most Merciful of all those who show mercy.",
    "Imam al-Taqi (a.s.)\nاَلْخَالِقُ اَعْظَمُ مِنَ الْمَخْلُوْقِيْنَ وَالرَّازِقُ اَبْسَطُ يَدًا مِنَ الْمَرْزُوْقِيْنَ وَنَارُ اللّٰهِ الْمُؤْصَدَةُ فِىْ عَمَدٍ مُّمَدَّدَةٍ تَكِيْدُ اَفْئِدَةَ الْمَرَدَةِ وَتَرُدُّ كَيْدَ الْحَسَدَةِ بِالْاَقْسَامِ بِالْاَحْكَامِ بِاللَّوْحِ الْمَحْفُوْظِ وَالْحِجَابِ الْمَضْرُوْبِ بِعَرْشِ رَبِّنَا الْعَظِيْمِ اِحْتَجَبْتُ وَاسْتَتَرْتُ وَاسْتَجَرْتُ وَاعْتَصَمْتُ وَتَحَصَّنْتُ بِالٓمٓ وَبِكٓهٰيٰعٓصٓ وَبِطٰهٰ وَبِطٰسٓمٓ وَبِحٰمٓ وَبِحٰمٓعٓسٓقٓ وَنٓ وَبِطٰسٓ وَبِقٓ وَالْقُرْاٰنِ الْمَجِيْدِ وَاَنَّهٗ لَقَسَمٌ لَوْ تَعْلَمُوْنَ عَظِيْمٌ وَاللّٰهُ وَلِيّى وَنِعْمَ الْوَكِيْلُ\nAL-KHAALIQU A'ZAMU MINAL MAKHLOOQEEN WAR RAAZIQU ABSATU YADAM MINAL MARZOOQEEN WA NAARULLAAHIL MOOSADATU FEE A'MADIM MUMADDADATIN TAKEEDU AF-IDATAL MARADATI WA TARUDDU KAYDAL HASADATI BIL AQSAAMI BIL AHKAAMI BIL LAWHIL MAHFOOZI WAL HIJAABIL MADROOBI BI-A'RSHI RABBINAL A'ZEEM, IHTAJABTU WASTATARTU WASTAJARTU WA A'TASAMTU WA TAHASSANTU BI-ALIF LAAM MEEM WA BI-KAAF HAA YAA A'YN SAAD WA BI-TAA HAA WA BI-TAA SEEN MEEM WA BI-HAA MEEM WA BI-HAA MEEM A'YN SEEN QAAF WA NOON WA BI-TAA SEEN WA BI-QAAF WAL QUR-AANIL MAJEED, WA ANNAHU LA-QASAMUL LAW TA'LAMOONA A'ZEEM, WALLAAHU WALIYYEE WA NI'MAL WAKEEL\nThe Creator is greater than the created; the Sustainer is more open-handed than those who are sustained; and the fire of Allah, sealed up in extended columns, torments the hearts of the rebellious and turns back the scheming of the envious — by the oaths, by the decrees, by the Preserved Tablet and the veil raised at the Throne of our Mighty Lord, have I taken shelter, sought concealment, sought refuge, held fast, and fortified myself with Alif Lam Meem, and with Kaf Ha Ya 'Ayn Sad, and with Ta Ha, and with Ta Seen Meem, and with Ha Meem, and with Ha Meem 'Ayn Seen Qaf, and with Noon, and with Ta Seen, and with Qaf, and the Glorious Qur'an — verily it is a mighty oath, if you but knew; and Allah is my Guardian, and how excellent a Guardian He is."
