  "merits": "Imam al-Sadiq (a.s.): Shaykh al-Kaf'ami, in al-Balad al-Amin (Baqiyat al-Salihat), has mentioned this supplicatory prayer as reported from Imam Ja'far al-Sadiq (a.s.), describing it as his evil-averting prayer (i.e. Hijab)."
